# "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a time counter on this artifact. Then if there are seven or more time counters on
# it, remove those counters and it deals 20 damage to you" (CR 122.1, 608.2c, 120.3). Turn 1: Bot1 pays for Cursed Recording with
# Black Lotus and a Mountain, then a Lightning Helix (Mox Ruby and Mox Pearl) at Bot2 is the first spell, gaining 3
# to 23. Turn 3: Manamorphose, each cast paid by the mana the one before added, is the second to the sixth: after the sixth there are
# six counters and no damage. The seventh gives the seventh counter, removes all of them and deals exactly 20 (23 to 3); the eighth
# starts again at one counter.

